---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /referrals/
title: Make a referral
seo_title: NDIS Referrals | Every Human Support Services
seo_description: Support coordinators, plan managers and LACs can refer participants to Every Human Support Services in Logan, Wollongong and Ulladulla in a couple of minutes.
---
{%- from "partials/icons.njk" import icon -%}
<section class="page-hd">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Make a referral</h1>
    <p class="lead">For support coordinators, plan managers, LACs, health professionals and families. It takes a couple of minutes, and we'll be in touch within one business day.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap contact-in">
    <div class="contact-side">
      <h2 class="h-sm">What happens next</h2>
      <ol class="mini-steps">
        <li>We confirm we've received your referral.</li>
        <li>We contact the participant or their nominee to arrange a meet and greet.</li>
        <li>We send a service agreement and match a support team.</li>
        <li>We keep you updated as supports begin.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="form-note">Registered NDIS provider. We accept agency, plan and self-managed participants, plus My Aged Care and private clients.</p>
    </div>
    <form class="form" name="referral" method="POST" action="/thanks/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="referral">
      <p class="hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Don't fill this out if you're human: <input name="bot-field" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="new-password"></label></p>

      <fieldset>
        <legend>Your details</legend>
        <div class="field-row">
          <div class="field"><label for="r-name">Your name</label><input id="r-name" name="referrer_name" autocomplete="name" required></div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="r-role">You are a</label>
            <select id="r-role" name="referrer_role" required>
              <option value="">Choose one</option>
              <option>Support coordinator</option>
              <option>Plan manager</option>
              <option>Local area coordinator (LAC)</option>
              <option>Health or allied health professional</option>
              <option>Family member or carer</option>
              <option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field"><label for="r-org">Organisation <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label><input id="r-org" name="referrer_org" autocomplete="organization"></div>
        <div class="field-row">
          <div class="field"><label for="r-phone">Phone</label><input id="r-phone" name="referrer_phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="r-email">Email</label><input id="r-email" name="referrer_email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset>
        <legend>Who you're referring</legend>
        <div class="field-row">
          <div class="field"><label for="p-name">Their name</label><input id="p-name" name="participant_name" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="p-phone">Their phone or their nominee's <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label><input id="p-phone" name="participant_phone" type="tel"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="field-row">
          <div class="field"><label for="p-suburb">Suburb</label><input id="p-suburb" name="participant_suburb" required></div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="p-location">Nearest location</label>
            <select id="p-location" name="location" required>
              <option value="">Choose one</option>
              {%- for l in collections.locations %}<option>{{ l.data.area }}</option>{% endfor %}
              <option>Somewhere else</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="p-funding">Funding</label>
          <select id="p-funding" name="funding" required>
            <option value="">Choose one</option>
            <option>NDIS, agency managed</option>
            <option>NDIS, plan managed</option>
            <option>NDIS, self managed</option>
            <option>Aged care (My Aged Care)</option>
            <option>Private</option>
            <option>Not sure yet</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <p class="label">Supports needed <span class="opt">(tick any)</span></p>
          <div class="checks">
            {%- for s in collections.services %}
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="supports[]" value="{{ s.data.nav_title }}"> {{ s.data.nav_title }}</label>
            {%- endfor %}
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="supports[]" value="Not sure"> Not sure</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field"><label for="p-notes">Anything we should know? <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label><textarea id="p-notes" name="notes" rows="4" placeholder="Goals, preferred days and times, preferences for support workers…"></textarea></div>
      </fieldset>

      <label class="check check-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="Yes" required> The person being referred (or their nominee) has agreed to this referral and to Every Human contacting them.</label>
      <p class="form-note">Please don't attach NDIS plans or medical reports here. We'll request them securely once we've made contact. See our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-go" type="submit">Send referral</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
